{"version":"7a2398a4-a983-42c8-86bf-f93e0d6abef8","items":[{"kind":"content","id":"e0451ba1-13a6-4bbd-8cc9-e8a9ca6ae255","type":"post","slug":"note-2026-04-24-2","title":"","description":"","excerpt":"","visibility":"public","coverMediaId":null,"publishedAt":"2026-04-24T00:00:00.000Z","isPinned":false,"post":{"bodyMarkdown":"人的精力是有限的\n\n想的多必定导致做得少\\\n做得少必然拿不到结果\\\n拿不到结果又导致继续想得多\n\n这是一个无限的恶性循环","collapsed":false,"media":[]},"tags":[]},{"kind":"content","id":"cde40088-1b9b-4811-83c2-a40383e279ed","type":"post","slug":"note-2026-04-24-1","title":"","description":"","excerpt":"","visibility":"public","coverMediaId":null,"publishedAt":"2026-04-24T00:00:00.000Z","isPinned":false,"post":{"bodyMarkdown":"如何对抗不确定性对精神和情绪的持续摧残\\\n我的一个缓解方法是\\\n少想，事情来了再解决\n\n你能解决的","collapsed":false,"media":[]},"tags":[]},{"kind":"content","id":"4475f713-edd0-4fbe-92c4-01a302a0d854","type":"post","slug":"note-2026-04-21-1","title":"","description":"","excerpt":"","visibility":"public","coverMediaId":null,"publishedAt":"2026-04-21T00:00:00.000Z","isPinned":false,"post":{"bodyMarkdown":"做规划的时候\\\n哪些事应该多想点\\\n哪些事应该别多想","collapsed":false,"media":[]},"tags":[]},{"kind":"content","id":"f718b3fc-41f4-4b71-9ea0-ff28f8ae04ab","type":"post","slug":"note-2026-04-20-1","title":"","description":"","excerpt":"","visibility":"public","coverMediaId":null,"publishedAt":"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z","isPinned":false,"post":{"bodyMarkdown":"压力大的后果就是变成肥猪啊","collapsed":false,"media":[]},"tags":[]},{"kind":"content","id":"bf76536e-cae9-455f-afdb-4520b0f63b26","type":"article","slug":"meritocracy-and-pain","title":"被优绩主义腌入味后，连痛苦都被剥夺了正当性","description":"","excerpt":"我为什么开始思考优绩主义呢？ 我曾经很相信这套东西，我甚至自诩为社会达尔文主义的信奉者。 我会认真规划每一个学期，想怎么把绩点再提一点，怎么让自己的履历更好看一点，怎么去争取一个更好的研究生去向。我把这些事想得很重要，也确实做得很认真。那时候我脑子不会想很多事情，只想着怎么拼命往上走。 于是我成了优绩主义最忠诚的执行者…","visibility":"public","coverMediaId":null,"publishedAt":"2026-04-01T16:00:00.000Z","isPinned":false,"post":null,"tags":[]}],"nextCursor":null}